radio-player (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite in C++ with Qt 6 Widgets and libmpv.
  * Inhibit sleep through the xdg-desktop-portal, falling back to the
    PowerManagement interface.
  * List every Radio Record station in the bundled catalog.
  * Let the buffer play out when the network drops.
  * Stop mpv from keeping played audio, which grew memory by up to 200 MiB.

